    "id": "10k_training_walkers",
    "name": "10K Training: Walkers",
    "author": "Hal Higdon",
    "version": "1.0",
    "created_at": null,
    "description": "MANY, IF NOT ALL, 10K RUNNING RACES WELCOME WALKERS. Sometimes walkers start well before the runners, sometimes they start after the runners, sometimes they start at the same time. Often, there are shorter-distance events welcoming walkers. (Tip: Start in the back so you don't embarrass yourself by forcing faster runners to go around you.) If your ... Continue reading \"Walkers\"",
